For each of the following endocrine glands, name a hormone it secretes and give its corresponding function:
thyroid;
adrenals

Draw a diagram of a long bone and label the following parts:
compact bone;
spongy bone;
bone marrow

Draw a large diagram of a transverse section of a root and label the following tissues:
dermal;
ground;
vascular.

The list below shows some of the organs of the alimentary canal. Write them in the correct order, starting with the mouth.
mouth;
stomach; rectum; large intestine; small intestine; oesophagus

Which one of the following veins links the small intestine to the liver?
Hepatic vein;
Hepatic portal vein;
Renal vein

